lemma":"ār","gloss":"to become full"},{"text":"பதம்","lemma":"patam","gloss":"food"}],"gloss":"filling food"},{"surface":"ஆக","parts":[{"text":"ஆக","lemma":"āku","gloss":"to become"}],"gloss":"as"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெரும்பெயர்","parts":[{"text":"பெருமை","lemma":"perumai","gloss":"greatness"},{"text":"பெயர்","lemma":"peyar","gloss":"name"}],"gloss":"of great fame"},{"surface":"உலகம்","parts":[{"text":"உலகம்","lemma":"ulakam","gloss":"world"}],"gloss":"world"},{"surface":"பெறீஇயரோ","parts":[{"text":"பெறீஇயரோ","lemma":"பெறீஇயரோ","gloss":"may she obtain indeed"}],"gloss":"may she obtain indeed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அன்னை","parts":[{"text":"அன்னை","lemma":"aṉṉai","gloss":"mother"}],"gloss":"mother"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தம்மில்","parts":[{"text":"தம்","lemma":"tām","gloss":"their"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"il","gloss":"house"}],"gloss":"in their own home"},{"surface":"தமதுண்டன்ன","parts":[{"text":"தமது","lemma":"tamatu","gloss":"their own"},{"text":"உண்டு","lemma":"uṇ","gloss":"having eaten"},{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"aṉṉa","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like eating their own"},{"surface":"சினைதொறும்","parts":[{"text":"சினை","lemma":"ciṉai","gloss":"branch"},{"text":"தொறும்","lemma":"torum","gloss":"every"}],"gloss":"on every branch"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தீம்பழம்","parts":[{"text":"தீமை","lemma":"tīmai","gloss":"sweetness"},{"text":"பழம்","lemma":"paḻam","gloss":"fruit"}],"gloss":"sweet fruit"},{"surface":"தூங்கும்","parts":[{"text":"தூங்கு","lemma":"tūṅku","gloss":"hang"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"hanging"},{"surface":"பலவின்","parts":[{"text":"பலவின்","lemma":"பலவின்","gloss":"of the jackfruit tree"}],"gloss":"of the jackfruit tree","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஓங்குமலை","parts":[{"text":"ஓங்கு","lemma":"ōṅku","gloss":"rise high"},{"text":"மலை","lemma":"malai","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"high mountain"},{"surface":"நாடனை","parts":[{"text":"நாடன்","lemma":"nāṭaṉ","gloss":"lord of the land"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ai","gloss":"accusative case marker"}],"gloss":"the lord of the land"},{"surface":"வரும்என்றாளே","parts":[{"text":"வரும்","lemma":"varu","gloss":"will come"},{"text":"என்று","lemma":"eṉṟu","gloss":"thus saying"},{"text":"ஆள்","lemma":"āḷ","gloss":"she"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"clitic of emphasis"}],"gloss":"she said he will come"}]}],"literal":"Rare to obtain ambrosia as filling food / may she obtain the great-named world, mother, / in their own home like eating their own, on every branch / sweet fruit hanging jackfruit tree's / high mountain lord, 'he will come', she said.","translation":"May mother attain the world of great renown, where the rare-to-obtain ambrosia is the daily food! For she has said, 'The lord of the high mountains—where sweet jackfruits hang from every branch, looking like people eating their own food in their own homes—will surely come.'","modern":"அரிய அமிழ்தத்தை உணவாகக் கொண்டு வாழும் புகழ்பெற்ற மேலுலகத்தை அன்னை பெறட்டும்! ஏனெனில், தன் சொந்த வீட்டில் தன் உணவை உண்பது போல, கிளைகள் தோறும் இனிய பழங்கள் தொங்கும் பலா மரங்கள் நிறைந்த உயர்ந்த மலைநாட்டை உடைய தலைவன் வருவான் என்று அவள் கூறினாள்.","explanation":"This poem is set in the Kuriñci landscape and spoken by the heroine's friend (tōḻi). The foster-mother has predicted or observed that the hero is coming to formally marry the heroine. Overjoyed by this news, the friend blesses the mother to reach the highest heaven where the gods feast on rare ambrosia. The mountain home of the hero is described as having jackfruit trees where sweet fruits hang from every branch, resembling people eating their own food in their own homes. This vivid image serves as an internal metaphor (uḷḷuṟai) representing a sweet, self-sufficient, and happy domestic life that awaits the heroine.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.38,1.82],[1.91,2.0],[2.0,3.2],[3.2,3.2],[3.2,3.84],[4.1,4.5],[4.5,5.0],[5.0,5.5],[5.5,5.58],[5.58,6.3],[6.3,7.5],[7.5,7.9],[7.9,8.2],[8.2,9.4],[9.4,9.8],[9.8,10.2],[10.2,10.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.45],[1.6,1.9],[2.05,2.2],[2.2,3.4],[3.4,3.5],[3.5,4.14],[4.4,4.9],[4.9,5.8],[5.8,6.2],[6.2,6.34],[6.34,7.16],[7.16,7.3],[7.3,8.9],[8.9,9.2],[9.2,10.5],[10.5,10.9],[10.9,11.3],[11.3,11.4]]}}